# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/alcaz-prison (level range is Blizzard's). The page lists
# 5 Horde quests, takeable from level 46-48, without their givers.
@dungeon Alcaz Prison
@levels 48-53
@window 46-54
@best 49
@hub Dustwallow Marsh, 36.0, 31.0, 10
@hub Tanaris, 51.6, 27.0, 5
@hub Orgrimmar, 50.0, 50.0
@entrance none
RUN @ Dustwallow Marsh, 70.3, 19 | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is on Alcaz Island, off the north-east coast of Dustwallow Marsh. Sergeant Ulka (Dustwallow Marsh 70.3, 19.0) gives A Little Payback and Blood Red Bandanas (from level 48); the bandanas are handed in to Eitrigg in Orgrimmar (34.4, 39.1). The Honor of the Kor'kron leads to Thrall Needs to Know, handed in to Thrall in Orgrimmar (32.0, 37.8). A prisoner inside gives The Man in the Iron Chains and then More Valuable Than Gold, which ends at Connery's Trunk in Westfall (43.4, 67.8). Take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
